        "node_id": "n_6_b64a23",
        "thought_text": "To avoid the error, we should handle the case where the non-repeating part of the decimal is empty by setting it to '0' before performing the integer conversion. This ensures that we always have a valid integer to work with, preventing the ValueError.",
